OL,3,GNEWSAPainting which went unnoticed for
OL,4,A150 years found on back of map
OL,5,
OL,6,FA striking watercolour of a bridge in
OL,7,Fthe Scottish Borders, which had gone
OL,8,Funnoticed in archives for more than 150
OL,9,Fyears, has been found by accident on
OL,10,Fthe back of a geological map.
OL,12,FLuis Albornoz-Parra, of the British
OL,13,FGeological Survey (BGS), stumbled on
OL,14,Fthe artwork while carrying out research
OL,15,Ffor Historic Environment Scotland (HES)
OL,16,Fon the building stones of Dryburgh
OL,17,FAbbey.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
