OL,3,GNEWSAPainting which went unnoticed for
OL,4,A150 years found on back of map
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe painting of the Dryburgh Suspension
OL,7,FBridge - on the back of geological
OL,8,Ffield notes - is believed to have been
OL,9,Fpainted by Benjamin Peach while
OL,10,Fconducting field work in the 1870s.
OL,12,FBGS said the artwork offered a
OL,13,F"snapshot of the iconic crossing" and
OL,14,Fis thought to be from just a year after
OL,15,Fit opened.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
